{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-q-momentum-building-block-values","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Example","doco:Section"],"label":"ex:q-momentum-building-block-values","kind":"example","title":"$q$-Momentum of the building-block knots","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-momentum","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-building-block-knots"],"tags":["momentum","q-deformed","writhe","braid","building-block-knots"],"text":"q-momentum-building-block-values.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"ex:q-momentum-building-block-values\"></a>\n<strong>Example.</strong> <em><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Momentum of the building-block knots</em></p>\n<p><strong>Building block values.</strong>\nThe <a href=\"#def:q-momentum\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-momentum</a> of the building-block knots, evaluated at the substrate value <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code>, coincides with the writhe of each braid representative:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Knot</th>\n<th>Braid word</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Writhe <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">w</code></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p_q(q_0)</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0_1</code> (unknot)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3_1</code> (trefoil)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1^3</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+3</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3_1^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1^{-3}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-3</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4_1</code> (figure-eight)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1 \\sigma_2^{-1} \\sigma_1 \\sigma_2^{-1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5_1</code> (cinquefoil)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1^5</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+5</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+5</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
